          'Some celebrants also want a brief pause just outside the venue entrance for a final group photo of the full court before walking in — a small moment that is easy to forget when planning the broader day but means a lot in the photos afterward. Mention this to your chauffeur so the vehicle stages with enough space nearby for that quick photo without blocking other arriving guests.',
